OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fovernight with clear spells, however
OL,7,Fthicker cloud across parts of Country
OL,8,FDurham and Northumberland will give
OL,9,Fsome outbreaks of rain later in the
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning on Tuesday
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain and drizzle,
OL,14,Fthe heaviest of which will be across
OL,15,Fthe north of the region.Brightening up
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon. Temperatures
OL,17,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
